title: Echo Valley
text: Shout across the valley and something comes back. Here, it comes back green.
trick: a head-on splitter sends part of the beam straight back through the filter and the tunnel, so the far side's colour comes home
motif: a ravine splits the board; a home side and a far side with one tunnel between
expect: depth>=3, reversals>=2
